        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'First, we will check you are positioned correctly


        Notice
        the <b>white orb</b> on the top of the controller. You will use this to touch
        some objects during the experiment.


        Hold this controller orb inside
        the blue <b>central orb</b> in front of you - this is the starting position
        you will take to begin each trial.


        Once the experimenter has checked
        your position, click <b>Next</b>.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
