        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'After this, you will be tested on your memory of which objects you
        saw, by touching one of 2 response orbs.


        Touch the <b>OLD</b> orb
        if the object <b>WAS ON</b> the table.

        Touch the <b>NEW</b> orb
        if the object <b>WAS NOT ON</b> the table.


        Try to make these judgements
        quickly, while being accurate.'
